[en.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_ZEBRAS_MILITARY_ACCESS]
Rainbow’s End

[en.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_ZEBRAS_MILITARY_ACCESS_desc]
Zebras seem to be unaware of how lucky they are. At the Rainbow’s End, there is a portal that can transport our army to the edge of Equestria. All we need is a request to cross the forest, a false pretense of passage.

[zh.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_ZEBRAS_MILITARY_ACCESS]
彩虹尽头

[zh.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_ZEBRAS_MILITARY_ACCESS_desc]
斑马或许并不知道，他们有多么幸运。彩虹尽头——那里的传送门可以将我们的军队输送到天涯海角。而我们所需要的，只是一纸穿越森林的请求，一种虚假的借道意愿。

